I don't think there's really a correct way to extract attributes off live tags--we've never really documented or supported that. If you want to submit a pull request to https://github.com/rstudio/htmltools (note: we'd require a CLA) adding accessor functions for retrieving tag name, attributes, and children, that'd probably be the place to clean up the duplicates.

