Subject: Re: Dynamically generating observers within observe()...?
Message-ID: <fXIHbPCmqb8.QQuujVHnQ7cJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <fXIHbPCmqb8.GvD3nzXw2G0J@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
